                                "sense_id": "9d84163b-18c6-392e-a146-ed9a0aa18b84",
                                "text": "Keening. I remember keening that seemed to go on all through the night: shrill, sharp, shiny, needles of sound piercing cleanly and deeply to let the anguish in, not out."
